EXTENSION "ARMDef_Against_the_Dark_Creatures_DanaslepihAZmaj" {
    NAME "Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Against the Dark - Danaslepih, a Zmaj"
    VERSION "0.5.0"
    SPEC_VERSION "0.5"
    RELEASE_DATE "2026-10-06"
    DEPENDS_ON "ARMDef_Against_the_Dark_Core_Ext"

    # Danaslepih, a Zmaj (Chapter Eight: Creatures, p107): one being, its printed stat lines verbatim fields.

    #t76763bf1a79e92f58aa114 ^"Danaslepih, a Zmaj" DEF {
        EXTENDS #taDz3ITq9fRoE374AgiL8VE4 ^"Creature"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Might Realm" STRING "Magic" FIXED
            ^"Might" INTEGER 25
            ^"Form" STRING "Animal"
            ^"Characteristics" DEF {
                ^"Intelligence" INTEGER 1
                ^"Perception" INTEGER 0
                ^"Presence" INTEGER -2
                ^"Communication" INTEGER -5
                ^"Strength" INTEGER 10
                ^"Stamina" INTEGER 3
                ^"Dexterity" INTEGER 3
                ^"Quickness" INTEGER -2
            }
            ^"Size" INTEGER 4
            ^"Season" STRING "Summer"
            ^"Confidence Score" STRING "2 (6)"
            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "Magical Animal; Magical Monster; Increased Characteristics (x3), Self-Confident, Tough (x2); Blind"
            ^"Magical Qualities & Inferiorities" STRING "Gigantic (x3), Greater Power (x3); Improved Attack, Improved Initiative, Improved Power, Personal Power (x3), Gift of Speech"
            ^"Combat" STRING "Bite: Init 0, Attack +17, Defense +9, Damage +13 Danaslepih can make multiple attacks in a single round, each attack using the statistics earlier. Because of the dragon’s size, he can only attack a specific Size 0 target twice in a single round. For each Size above 0, the dragon can add an additional attack to that target in the same round."
            ^"Soak" INTEGER 9
            ^"Fatigue Levels" STRING "OK, 0, –1, –3, –5, Unconscious"
            ^"Wound Penalties" STRING "–1 (1–9), –3 (10–18), –5 (19–27), Incapacitated (28–36), Dead (37+)"
            ^"Powers" STRING "The Beast with Five Heads, 0 points, Constant, Animal: This constant power gives Danaslepih five additional heads, for a total of six. It does not regrow lost heads or regenerate damaged heads. This effect is achieved by buying the Magical Quality: Personal Power thrice and the Magical Quality: Improved Powers once. Each head can speak and make an attack. (Base 25, +2 Sun, +1 constant, +4 additional heads) Assuming the Horse-chestnut, 4 points, Init –6, Animal: The dragon can turn into a tree. He can assume the shape of a standing tree by standing on his hind legs before the transformation, or a fallen tree by lying down. (Base 10, +1 Conc, +1 Herbam requisite, +3 Size adjustment) The Field Made Fallow, 4 points, Init –6, Herbam: Danaslepih can wither crops and destroy a field with a touch of his claw. This power can destroy a group of up to 10,000 plants. (Base 5, +1 Touch, + 2 Group, +3 to affect a larger group) The Captive Encased in Bark, 3 points, Init –7, Corpus: Danaslepih’s breath can change a person into a tree, a horse-chestnut similar to, but not as large as, the same kind of tree the zmaj can become. His nostrils need to be very close to the subject, effectively Touch range. (Base 25, +1 Touch, +3 Moon, +1 Herbam requisite; excess levels used as mastery points to reduce point cost by 2) Inquiry of the Leafy Sentinel, 3 points, Init –5, Herbam: Danaslepih can speak with trees and shrubs. (Base 15, +1 Touch, +1 Diam)"
            ^"Vis" STRING "5 pawns of Animal vis located in the five most prominent dorsal scales on the dragon’s back."
            ^"Appearance" STRING "Danaslepih has green scales that look as if they are tinged with mold, but it is merely his coloring. Long, lean, and low to the ground, his body is 40 feet long from fangs to tail, but stands only 6 feet high at the shoulders. His six heads twist and writhe like snake tongues tasting the air, motionless only when he is stalking prey."
            ^"Source" STRING "Against the Dark"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 107
        }
        PERSONALITY_TRAITS {
            "Protective" +6
            "Aloof" +3
            "Disrespectful" +3
        }
        ABILITIES {
            "Athletics" SCORE 3 SPECIALTY "climbing"
            "Awareness" SCORE 2 SPECIALTY "listening"
            "Brawl" SCORE 9 SPECIALTY "large teeth"
            "Stealth" SCORE 3 SPECIALTY "hiding"
            "South Slavonic" SCORE 3 SPECIALTY "Serbian"
            "Survival" SCORE 3 SPECIALTY "forests"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Danaslepih is young by zmaj standards. Born blind, he has developed acute senses of smell and hearing, and can travel about his territory effortlessly. He knows the smell of every plant in the Tribunal, and if he smells grain crops growing too close to his home, he destroys them. His lair is hidden among a closely growing group of horse-chestnut trees along the Drina River in western Serbia.\n\nDanaslepih generally prowls the borders of his territory, hunting deer and protecting his grove from encroaching farmers. He is not violent, although he can be very rude. When encountering a farmer, he destroys the man’s crops and changes the farmer into a tree. Like other zmajevi, Danaslepih is looking for a wife."
    }

}
